Add optional sequential queries within existing DNS upstream lists.

Set dns.query-mode: sequential to try each server in configuration order.
Each DNS server gets its own timeout (default 5s). Set
dns.query-attempt-timeout (for example 800ms) to change it.
The caller's deadline and cancellation still apply.

The default mode is parallel. Preserve fallback-lazy-query and the
internal resolution strategy of system:// and dhcp:// clients.

